get.description:
Receiving realtime events from server. Response example:
- {"type":"CameraAbnormal", "data":1}
- {"type":"Cluster", "data":{"status":Register, "message":""}}
- {"type":"ClusterSync", "data":{"status":SyncComplete, "message":""}}
- {"type":"ClusterAbnormal", "data":[2,3]}
- {"type":"Tracking", "data":{"cameraId":1, "width":1920, "height":1080, "nowPlaying":1, "objects":[{"id":1, "object":{"confidence":0.893257, "type":"car", "region":{"x":792, "y":148, "w":257, "h":230}}}]}}

- {"type":"Streaming", "data":{"source":1, "type":"live", "image":"base64...."}}
- {"type":"EngineModelLoaded", "data":{"status":"Loaded"}}
- {"type":"EngineModelLoading","data":{"status":"Loading"}}

References:
https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Server-sent_events/Using_server-sent_events
https://github.com/Yaffle/EventSource/ for authentication support
